  "bodyHash": "bh1GAzheaVk=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Edo5jnW.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/%E9%81%A9%E7%94%A8%E9%96%B1%E5%85%8B-1.19-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"248\" height=\"28\" />&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%9D%E7%92%B0%E5%A2%83-%E7%95%AB%E9%9D%A2%20%26%20%E4%BC%BA%E6%9C%8D%E5%99%A8-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiky-spikes/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689%3A7498\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiky-spikes/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689%3A7499\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📖 關於：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>尖刺尖刺</strong>增加了許多非常尖銳的尖刺。分成多種等級，每種都有獨特的能力。還在等什麼？快來改善你的生怪塔吧！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📚 內容：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">尖刺尖刺為你帶來<strong>6種等級</strong>的尖刺，每種都獨一無二。</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>木質：</strong>緩慢傷害生物，但不會造成致命一擊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>石質：</strong>能傷害並殺死生物，但不會掉落任何戰利品或經驗值。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>鐵質：</strong>能傷害並殺死生物，只掉落普通戰利品，無經驗值。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>黃金：</strong>能傷害並殺死生物，只掉落經驗值，無任何戰利品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>鑽石：</strong>造成大量傷害，生物會掉落所有戰利品，就像被玩家殺死一樣。可使用大多數劍類附魔，透過鐵砧施加。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>獄髓：</strong>造成大量傷害，生物會掉落所有戰利品，就像被玩家殺死一樣。可使用大多數劍類附魔，透過鐵砧施加。抗爆炸，且不會被凋零怪破壞。對玩家不會造成傷害。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>注意：</strong>為鑽石和獄髓尖刺添加附魔時，請確保一次備齊所有想要附魔的尖刺。你可以對<strong>整組物品</strong>應用附魔書，所以之後再附魔更多尖刺會不必要地消耗更多珍貴的書本。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📷 媒體：</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/957/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/958/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>尖刺尖刺真的很尖銳</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>木質尖刺能將生物削到只剩半顆心</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/959/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/960/2022-08-31_23.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>就連凋零怪也無法從獄髓尖刺下倖免</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>所有可施加在尖刺上的附魔</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>💡 常見問題：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：如何在 Forge 上設定此模組？</strong><br /><strong>答：</strong>安裝我的<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a>模組，然後直接在遊戲內設定！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：如何在 Fabric 上設定此模組？</strong><br /><strong>答：</strong>目前尚未實現在遊戲內直接編輯設定。請在進入世界後執行 <code>/config showfile &lt;modid&gt;</code> 指令，並選擇 <code>CLIENT</code> 或 <code>SERVER</code>（取決於模組），接著點擊聊天中出現的檔案名稱（以 .toml 結尾），即可在另一個編輯器中手動編輯設定檔。儲存檔案後，設定會在數秒後自動在遊戲內重新載入，無需重新啟動遊戲。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>🏆 鳴謝：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">開發尖刺尖刺受到以下啟發與協助：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/rwtema\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>RWTema</strong></span></a> 啟發了這個模組，參考了其舊版<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-utilities\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Extra Utilities</span></a>模組中的尖刺方塊</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/xfacthd\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>XFactHD</strong></span></a> 帶領我接觸在 Minecraft 中渲染非方塊形狀的深奧技術</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&amp;message=LunaPixelStudios&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs_&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzss&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=u/Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=reddit&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs%200212&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-infuser-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ALHMDQn.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mlxi8cy.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e4TeVgY.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tiny-skeletons-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GCYM7Zl.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q3CooZb.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vz0tBff.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ej6YE7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
